WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:34.970
‎This story is a work of fiction. The names of all of the characters, organizations, and so on
are imaginary. It also bears no connection to any specific real-life events.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:44.150
Episode 48     The Beginning

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:53.820
What are you doing, Lord Jinshi?

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:56.990
No! This isn't what it looks like!

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.370
Lord Jinshi, your face.

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.290
It is nothing serious. Just a scratch.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.960
Let me see.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.140
Excuse me.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.690
It's been stitched rather carelessly.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:31.900
I would redo it right away,
but my hands are too tired.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:35.570
Did you go to the front lines?

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.950
I could hardly sit in a safe place
and just watch.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:43.000
I think that's fine.
That is your position, after all.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.330
Please do not go to dangerous places
on purpose.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.590
When you get hurt,
it causes trouble for everyone around you.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:52.050
True.

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:55.300
I did not intend to get injured.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:00.140
No one ever does.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:08.270
I accepted a strange request, that is all.

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:14.690
Were you close with Loulan?

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:19.910
Were you friends?

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.910
I am not really sure.

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.170
Friends?

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:33.420
At the very least, I think
it was something close to that for me.

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.670
Spending time talking with Loulan,

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:40.010
with Shisui and Xiaolan,

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.550
it was not so bad.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:47.020
Although I do not know how Shisui felt.

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:52.900
She was truly hard to understand.

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:56.400
I feel the same.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.790
I never did figure her out.

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.290
I see.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:09.790
So, Shisui.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.290
I leave the rest to you.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.510
The only thing I can do

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:20.130
is carry out what she entrusted to me.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:21.970
That is all.

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:27.560
It is done.

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:29.690
Thank you.

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:33.230
You look terrible. You should rest.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.440
Yeah. I am really sleepy.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:37.820
Please do not fall asleep here.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.950
Why not? I am tired.

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:41.700
If you must ask.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.120
This place is tainted.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.200
I know that.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.660
In that case.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.340
His hand.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.050
It is so cold.

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:02.430
Then why are you here?

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.350
Even I can feel pity for children.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:09.730
Is that so? But did your herbal master not

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:12.060
forbid you from touching corpses?

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:14.980
He remembered that?

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:19.820
Which makes it hard to believe you would
stay in a place like this for long.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.900
Sharp intuition
when it is least convenient.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:27.160
How should I cover this up?

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:30.620
What happened to your wound?

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.960
There was an unpleasant person.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.210
You were attacked?

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.960
By a woman.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:41.420
What is it with him? Why must he meddle
in matters of other people's chastity?

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:44.930
Will it leave a scar?

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.510
This much will fade quickly.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.680
Do not let it scar.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:53.900
May I return those words to you?

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.610
I am a man. It does not matter.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.940
Lord Jinshi, you are beyond that.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:02.570
I do not care.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.610
Then I do not either.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.780
If one scar could ruin my value,

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:08.700
then I lacked worth.

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:15.040
Hey.

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:17.040
Am I a man

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:20.880
whose value disappears
with a single scratch?

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.880
Am I just a pretty face
with nothing inside?

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:30.180
If anything,

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:33.940
a few more scars might suit you.

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:37.060
Lord Jinshi is too beautiful.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:40.070
Because of that,
people around him become flustered,

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.360
focused only on his appearance.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:47.200
But his true nature is not
as flashy as his looks.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.740
It is something far more honest.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:53.620
That probably has more value than beauty.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:58.130
I would say,
you are more handsome than ever.

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.800
What is it?

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:13.890
I was trying to restrain myself,
considering the circumstances.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.940
If you are sleepy, you should--

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:22.860
I thought I could stay calm.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.320
- Huh?
- But it turns out,

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.030
I did better than expected.

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:31.700
What is this situation?

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:36.080
Lord Jinshi, perhaps you really
should get some rest?

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.410
I am still fine.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.170
Then I will get some painkillers.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:41.670
I can hold on for 30 more minutes.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.590
Thirty minutes, for what?

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:47.050
What nonsense is he spouting
with that worn-out face?

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:51.890
I can't.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.270
What was that sound just now?

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:00.860
Hey!

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:05.070
No!

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:10.410
It is not that!

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:23.000
It's medicine.

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:26.960
Shisui called it a medicine, not a poison.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:30.640
A medicine that kills once,
then brings one back,

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.050
"A medicine to revive the dead."

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:44.360
She is alive?

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:48.150
Lord Jinshi!
Please prepare some hot water!

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:51.740
And something warm!
Clothes, food, anything!

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:55.870
I don't know what Lord Jinshi will do
with the revived child.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:59.710
Still, this is why I was brought here.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.830
One who died once.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:07.050
Then, you will let
"those who died once" go?

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.170
It feels like I've been tricked by a fox.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:13.010
- Lord Jinshi!
- I got it.

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:22.690
Hey! Bring warm water in a bucket!
And blankets!

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:25.310
- Also prepare some warm drinks!
- Yes!

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:29.610
Lord Jinshi!

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:39.740
Send some people over!
If possible, Suirei!

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:42.420
- Gaoshun, please.
- Got it.

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:57.800
We'll set up here.

00:09:57.810 --> 00:09:59.390
Thank you very much.

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:04.150
Shall we continue this later?

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:06.440
Yes, yes.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:17.830
Suirei.

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:21.330
The children have come back to life.

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:25.670
Hey!

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.070
It's a happy start to the new year,
isn't it?

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:53.400
I hear the Crown Prince
is finally being presented?

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:54.690
It seems so.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:58.660
With all the celebrations, the guests are
spending generously.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:01.290
Granny is happily counting her money.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:11.170
The new Empress was confirmed as Consort
Gyokuyou, Maomao's former mistress.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:25.480
The birth went smoothly.

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:29.980
Old man didn't return to the pleasure
district, he chose to stay in the palace.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:34.530
He was exiled from the rear palace
for absurd reasons to begin with.

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.990
But his skills as a physician
are exceptional.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:39.910
Naturally, they would not want
to send him back.

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:45.870
As for Lord Jinshi,
I have not seen him since that day.

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:50.290
He's probably busy handling the affairs of
the Shi clan and with his regular duties.

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:54.710
Good news, in a way.

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:59.340
But it also meant I was no longer
needed in the rear palace.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:04.850
Nonetheless, the pleasure district
is busier anyway.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:08.390
The medicines the old man stockpiled
are long gone.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:11.020
Hey, Freckles! Give me a snack!

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.020
Don't run around too much.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.320
You were bedridden not too long ago, remember?

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:17.240
I'm fine now!

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:20.110
All five children
came back to life after that.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:24.370
He was the last to awaken.

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:28.370
The medicine is still experimental.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:32.500
Truthfully, I wanted to wait
until it was proven effective.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:36.750
The last one, Kyou-u, lost his memory

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:39.010
and suffered minor paralysis on one side.

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:44.600
Even so, coming back from that state
is a miracle.

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:49.560
The other children were all given
new names and allowed to live on.

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:54.860
I don't know why,
but the four who awoke earlier

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.230
were apparently taken in by Lady Ah-Duo,

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.450
a former high-ranking consort.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.240
And Suirei too.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:06.830
Though she had stirred up
much trouble in the palace,

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.910
her case was seen with leniency.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:12.750
She carries the previous Emperor's blood.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.250
She is now under surveillance,
but her life was spared.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.250
As for Kyou-u, because of his memory loss,

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:21.420
it was decided he'd be raised separately,

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:24.180
and so he was brought
to the pleasure district.

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:29.310
But what kind of logic is it that,
"In a way, this is the safest place"?

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:31.600
There it is! Ow!

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.770
What was that for?

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:35.940
Don't eat without asking, you dumb Chou-u.

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:39.990
Kyou-u is now called Chou-u. A new name.

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.490
Since he still remembered the sound of
his old name, it was the best we could do.

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:46.740
Chou-u, over here.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.830
Yay! Play with me!

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:57.000
Seki-u?

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.670
Long time no see.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.300
I heard you were an apothecary,

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:05.590
but didn't expect your store
to be in the pleasure district.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:07.760
Has the Crown Prince
been presented already?

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:12.270
Yes, and it went smoothly.
Everyone gave their best regards to you.

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.350
And this! I've been holding onto it.

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:17.570
I must give it for my peace of mind.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:20.570
SHISUI
MAOMAO

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:21.690
Xiaolan.

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:25.360
She was really down
after you and Shisui disappeared.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:27.410
She expected a note at least.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:30.580
Officially, Shisui and I were extracted

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:34.160
and transferred
out of the rear palace, right?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:35.750
That's right.

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:40.000
However, having a cheerful personality
has its advantages.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.340
She is not especially talented,
but you just can't leave her alone.

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:52.350
Well, take care.

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:54.270
You too, Seki-u.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:02.320
Lady Seki-u told me all about how

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:03.780
Xiaolan had been doing.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:06.860
MAOMAO
SHISUI

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:08.160
It seems that after we left,

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:12.330
she couldn't just leave her alone,

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.660
working hard all by herself
in the bathhouse.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.170
I see.

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:21.050
Xiaolan is already...

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:33.430
"Maomao, are you doing well?"

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:35.270
I'm doing great.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:40.020
After completing my apprenticeship,
I left the palace.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:43.690
The princess who gave me the hair clip
liked me,

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:47.150
she introduced me to her younger sister,
and now

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:48.530
I'm working as her maid.

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:52.790
I intend to give it my all!

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:58.830
I really wish I'd had the chance
to tell you everything properly.

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:08.470
I hope to meet you
and Shisui again someday.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:12.140
I want to eat frozen treats together
like we used to.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:28.700
SHISUI

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:33.830
Snow, huh.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.040
They couldn't find

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:45.210
Shisui's body no matter how much
they dug through the snow.

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:51.390
They said they would search again
once the snow melted in spring.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.980
I hope they never find it.

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.110
THE VERDIGRIS HOUSE

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:16.450
This new medicine
still doesn't feel quite right.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:21.870
Oh, okay.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.170
What are you up to?

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:28.500
Lord Jinshi, have you finished your work?

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.380
I can take breaks occasionally.

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:36.260
Here you go. Enjoy at your leisure.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.140
What the heck?

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:43.980
He's all healed up.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.650
Did the old man redo the stitches?

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:49.400
You seem tired.

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.530
It's not just the personnel affairs,

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:55.620
I'm also dealing with the Shi clan's
territory and various things.

00:17:57.120 --> 00:18:01.410
Most of the Shi clan has already
been executed, from what I heard.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:04.370
Their territory is now
under direct control of the state.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:09.170
It is rich in forest resources, so
the government should profit handsomely.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:13.380
If they use the lumber to make paper,
that would be great.

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:16.760
Hey. Stop pretending I am not here.

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.640
Sorry, it's a habit.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:23.680
Never mind.
How about you keep your promise?

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:24.890
Promise?

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:26.980
I gathered the ingredients
for the ice cream, right?

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.980
Ice cream? Oh, the hair clip!

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.190
What's wrong?

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:34.400
No, it's just, the hair clip...

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:37.030
- I gave it away.
- What?

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.620
Maybe I'll find it in the spring.

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:41.870
Why spring?

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:44.920
Or I might not.

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:49.130
It might end up
at some street stall somewhere.

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:52.090
- You sold it off?
- I didn't sell it!

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:54.840
I gave it to Shisui.

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.390
To Loulan.

00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:01.140
I did say that
I would want it back someday.

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:03.020
I see.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:07.600
Then, how about you
fulfill the other promise?

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:10.400
"Hear the whole story
before reacting," right?

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:11.360
That's right.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:15.320
All right then. Go ahead.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:19.240
Go ahead?

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:22.410
You don't have one?

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:24.750
No, there is,

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:28.710
but, thinking it over, I figure
you already know what I was going to say.

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:32.300
Well, it's too late
to talk about that now.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.970
Then, how about something else instead?

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:36.970
Something else?

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:40.010
So there isn't anything after all?

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:54.610
What are you doing?

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:56.780
Do you get what this means?

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:00.820
You do realize that human saliva
can be poisonous in some cases?

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:05.870
You are immune to most poisons,
are you not?

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:10.290
What? Are you trying to bite me to death?

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:18.550
I feel like doing that.

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:20.140
Wait.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:23.970
Let us resume from
where we left off at the fortress.

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:31.900
He really is beautiful.

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:40.240
Are you holding some poison inside too?

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.240
Freckles!

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:48.700
Look! You wanted this, right?

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:50.330
Oh! Good job!

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:54.090
- It's huge!
- Right?

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:57.340
Why do we always get interrupted?

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:59.510
What's with that guy?

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:02.340
He's just tired.

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:04.550
Here, some brown sugar as a reward.

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:07.180
See ya!

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.940
Granny, can you prep a bed?

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.650
Make sure it's comfortable.

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:17.780
Got it!

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:25.950
You seem tired, so please rest well.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.330
Got it. I'll rest.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.290
I will use this as my pillow.

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.210
Lord Jinshi?

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:40.510
Are you pretending to sleep? Lord Jinshi?

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:47.680
My legs are starting to go numb.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.670
Okay, here's your order.

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:19.130
Thanks for your business!

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:21.210
- Uncle.
- Yes.

00:22:22.470 --> 00:22:24.050
Is this a cicada?

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:28.760
Ah, it's a well-made jade
from ancient times.

00:22:28.760 --> 00:22:30.890
Oh, jade, huh?

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:32.730
Hey, that's merchandise.

00:22:32.730 --> 00:22:35.850
Don't just browse, are you buying or not?

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:38.400
I don't have much money.

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:40.860
Then hands off, all right?

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:44.400
How about a barter? Here, take this.

00:22:44.990 --> 00:22:48.320
A hair clip? What is this?

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:50.910
You don't see things like this
around here!

00:22:52.950 --> 00:22:54.000
So? Deal?

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.250
Where did you get this, young girl?

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:58.460
Never mind! Deal's done!

00:22:58.460 --> 00:23:00.170
Then I'll take it!

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:05.840
It's beautiful.

00:23:09.760 --> 00:23:11.060
Hey, Uncle!

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:15.060
My name's Tamamo!

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:18.060
"Tamamo" as in Tama for jade
and Mo as in seaweed, huh?

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:21.400
Sounds like a name blessed by the sea.

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:25.820
That's right.

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:29.320
I bet it'd be fun to see
what's across the sea.

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:34.870
Thanks, uncle!

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:38.830
Bye-bye!

00:23:41.920 --> 00:23:43.920
Subtitle translation by:
Abhishek Chand Ramola
